<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρέκ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεκ-είη</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεκ-ίη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Man.
			3.229
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτρεκής</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>precise truth, certainty,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				213.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἡμεῖς ἀτρεκείην ἴδμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.152
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαθεῖν . . τὴν ἀ. ὅτι οὐκ
				αἱρέει</span> learnt <i>for certain</i> that he is unable
			to take it, ib.<i><span class="en">
				82
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).880
			</span></i> (Corc.): in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς -ας τὰς λεγομένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀτρέκεια</span> personified, <i>Strict
				Justice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				91
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
